@title Single-line diagram: a stated diversity factor shows in the box, the schedule and the legend
@area Reports
# Open a small distribution board, find the single-line diagram by its plain name, look at the drawing and the schedule.
open qa/fixtures/distribution-board-diversity.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text single line
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
shot single-line-diversity-diagram
check_blank single-line-diversity-diagram
check_layout
click_text Schedule #1
wait 10
shot single-line-diversity-schedule
check_layout
